    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida/sceneV_35.10/p@217492",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PANDARUS.\nA goodly medicine for my aching bones! O world! world! Thus is the poor agent despis’d! O traitors and bawds, how earnestly are you set a-work, and how ill requited! Why should our endeavour be so lov’d, and the performance so loathed? What verse for it? What instance for it? Let me see—",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida/sceneV_35.10/p@217492/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida/sceneV_35.10/p@217492/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 298,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6319447,
        "end": 6319778,
        "line": 235884,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap35/p@217492",
        "anchor": "sceneV_35.10"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PANDARUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida/sceneV_35.10/p@217827",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "  Full merrily the humble-bee doth sing\n  Till he hath lost his honey and his sting;\n  And being once subdu’d in armed trail,\n  Sweet honey and sweet notes together fail.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida/sceneV_35.10/p@217827/line-1",
